From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:11:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 332/638] blink: extend extraction archive visibility

Respect Blink Platform's nonempty file-level visibility default when admitting the focused root extraction target. GN rejects replacing that inherited list directly.

AI_PHASE: chromium-blink-platform-library

AI_STATUS: first-complete-archive-gn-failure-corrected

AI_VALIDATION: gn gen failed exactly at BUILD.gn:1879 with 'Replacing nonempty list'

AI_EVIDENCE: out/aros-blink-platform/test-artifacts/-blink-platform-library-20260725/01-complete-archive-gn-root-extra-deps.log

AI_LIMITATIONS: dependency graph generation and archive build still require replay

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; c59604b96e
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn
index 5614b39934..cb24eb8e97 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn
@@ -1876,7 +1876,7 @@ if (is_aros && aros_blink_platform_library_only) {
   # until the AROS import bridge has been proven independently.
   static_library("aros_blink_platform_archive") {
     complete_static_lib = true
-    visibility = [ "//:gn_all" ]
+    visibility += [ "//:gn_all" ]
     deps = [ ":platform" ]
   }
 }
